# TCP 443, 8890                AV / IPS updates
# UDP 500, ESP (IP 50)         IPsec
# UDP 500, 4500                IPsec with NAT-T
# TCP 514                      FortiManager / FortiAnalyzer
# UDP 1812 / 1813              RADIUS auth / accounting
# TCP/UDP 389, 636             LDAP / LDAPS
# UDP 5246, 5247               CAPWAP
# TCP 8000, 8001               FSSO
# TCP 8013, UDP 8014           FortiTelemetry
# TCP/UDP 703                  HA sync
# Ethertype 0x8890/91/93       HA heartbeat / sync
